  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "To duplicate;\n\nBe on VR with a wireless VR headset (In my case;  Vive Pro with a wireless adapter.  Might also happen with wireless audio headsets, I can't confirm myself)\n\nDisconnect the headset (unplug it from the battery, lose sight of the antenna, generally just cause a disconnection event to occur).\n\nWhen connection is re-established, any active audio source is now broken and won't play anything (eg; video players) until rejoining the world.",
